  CITATION CONTRACT. The baseline test failures register, a mandated deliverable of
  this same change set at docs/migration/baseline-test-failures.md, derives every
  row from XML archived in this tree and cites each source file by path, in the form
  docs/migration/smoke-evidence/baseline/surefire/MODULE/TEST-FULLY.QUALIFIED.CLASS.xml
